sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Soldier as Soldier Wearable Node
    participant Relay1 as Primary Relay (Ridge-Alpha)
    participant Relay2 as Backup Relay (Ridge-Bravo)
    participant Base as Tactical Base Gateway
    actor Commander as Rescue Command Dashboard

    %% Phase 1: Routine Telemetry
    Note over Soldier,Commander: Phase 1: Routine Telemetry (SAFE State)
    Soldier->>Relay1: RF Broadcast Telemetry (Interval 3000ms, SAFE)
    Relay1->>Relay1: Check Dup Cache (Unique) -> Increment Hop
    Relay1->>Base: High-Power Forward (+20 dBm)
    Base->>Commander: Serial JSON Stream -> Dashboard Map & Metrics Updated

    %% Phase 2: Emergency Casualty Event
    Note over Soldier,Commander: Phase 2: Casualty Emergency (Impact > 4.5g OR SOS Pressed)
    Soldier->>Soldier: Sensor Fusion detects Impact (5.4g) + Fall + Immobility
    Soldier->>Soldier: Latch EMERGENCY State: Rapid LED Strobe + Haptic Motor
    Soldier->>Relay1: Priority Emergency Beacon (Interval 750ms, EMERGENCY)
    Relay1->>Base: Forward Priority Emergency Frame
    Base->>Base: Trigger Local Red Strobe + Dual-Tone Acoustic Siren
    Base->>Base: Render Soldier Vitals & GPS on Base OLED Screen
    Base->>Commander: Stream Emergency JSON (Flag: CRITICAL_CASUALTY)
    Commander->>Commander: Audio-Visual Dashboard Warning + Triage Assessment
    Commander->>Base: Operator Press "ACKNOWLEDGE" -> Mutes Acoustic Siren

    %% Phase 3: Relay Node Failure & Dynamic Mesh Rerouting
    Note over Soldier,Commander: Phase 3: Relay-01 Failure & Mesh Self-Healing
    Relay1-xRelay1: Relay-01 Battery Depleted / Jammed (OFFLINE)
    Soldier->>Relay1: Transmit Emergency Telemetry Frame
    Note right of Soldier: No ACK / Link Dead on Primary Path
    Soldier->>Relay2: Dynamic Failover to Secondary Channel (Ridge-Bravo)
    Relay2->>Relay2: Inspect Frame -> Set backup_route_active=true
    Relay2->>Base: Forward via Alternate Mesh Route
    Base->>Commander: Stream Telemetry with Alternate Path Badge
    Commander->>Commander: Display "Route Failover: DELTA-01 -> RELAY-02 -> BASE"
